hallenge Cluedo fans from around the world. You can even set up a nostalgic games night with your friends and family in Private Multiplayer! \n\nWhodunit? With what weapon? Where? There’s six suspects, six weapons, nine rooms, and only one answer…\n\nHOW TO PLAY CLUEDO: CLASSIC EDITION: \n1. Three cards are hidden away at the start of the game – these cards are the solution to the crime.\n2. Each player gets three Clue Cards. These can’t be part of the solution, so they are automatically crossed off your clue sheet. \n3. Roll the dice and move your token around the board.\n4. If you choose to enter a room, you can make a suggestion. Pick who you think committed the crime, with what weapon and where. \n5. Each player then takes it in turn to compare your suggestion against the cards they hold. If they have a card that features in your suggestion, they’ll tell you. \n6. Cross off any cards other players have shown you and whittle down your list of suspects.\n7. When you are ready, you can make an accusation! If your accusation is wrong, you’re out of the game!\n\nFEATURES\n- CROSS-PLATFORM MULTIPLAYER – Play with your friends and family on PC, mobile and Nintendo Switch.\n- ONLINE LEADERBOARDS – Outsmart fans around the world with weekly online leaderboards.\n- MULTIPLE MODES – Face up to six players in Online Multiplayer, or take on customisable AI suspects in Single Player Mode. \n- PRIVATE LOBBIES – Set up a family game night easily with the Play with Friends Mode.\n\nCatch the criminal! Play Cluedo: Classic Edition today!", "sellerUrl": "https://www.marmaladegamestudio.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "PT", "ZH", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "871982080", "formattedPrice": "￦11,000", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 331, "trackContentRating": "12+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.63142, "releaseDate": "2018-07-03T13:42:41Z", "trackId": 1238247658, "trackName": "Cluedo: Classic Edition", "userRatingCount": 331}]}